Per [Xinhua](https://www.gov.cn/lianbo/202611/content_7087372.htm), the plan also calls for:

- large-scale 5G-Advanced coverage and joint BeiDou-plus-5G infrastructure;
- evolving network architecture around AI applications, with a national platform to monitor and schedule computing power;
- drafting a telecom law and a radio spectrum law, and encouraging private companies to take part.
